// both fades emit their three `(px & m) >> n & m` terms in the order
// 0x694d64, 0x694d60, 0x694d68, and the 24->16 importer at 0x44f0f4
// pairs source byte 0 with 0x694d64, byte 1 (green in every 24-bit
